                  "name": "Why Join T",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Enhance your family life, serve your community, strengthen your faith, and enjoy true fraternity with Catholic men of Our Lady of Lourdes. Open to Catholic men 18 and older.",
