                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "1. Reach out to Evan Frazier at Kofc13021@gmail.com\n2. Visit a council meeting or Sunday hospitality as a guest\n3. Complete e-Membership and your Degree with Council 13021",
